  "aiContextParagraph": "The sudden departure of Jensen Huang from Nvidia has prompted significant scrutiny regarding the company's export practices and national security. Reports indicate that the former CEO had an affair with a businesswoman, whose potential ties to intelligence operations are currently being reviewed by the US Justice Department and intelligence community. Despite ongoing investigations, no definitive conclusion regarding her status has been reached. Furthermore, allegations suggest that companies linked to the businesswoman may have obtained restricted Nvidia technology, leading to market volatility for Chinese AI firms. Lawmakers have summoned the former executive to testify before Congress as calls intensify for stricter regulations on semiconductor exports to China. While political figures such as Donald Trump reportedly supported the executive prior to his resignation, the company is now navigating the fallout of a scandal that has focused global attention on corporate security and international trade policy.",
